[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13447.295, "timestamp": "03:44:07", "text": "这是什么歌？只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13448.469, "timestamp": "03:44:08", "text": "[倒吸一口气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13456.229, "timestamp": "03:44:16", "text": "阿里和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13461.429, "timestamp": "03:44:21", "text": "优由纪由香里。那些不就是虚拟歌手吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13463.67, "timestamp": "03:44:23", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.03, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13466.87, "timestamp": "03:44:26", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13475.429, "timestamp": "03:44:35", "text": "另外，我们会去掉那1分钟的限制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13478.71, "timestamp": "03:44:38", "text": "从这里开始。我把它缩短到2秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13495.349, "timestamp": "03:44:55", "text": "然后跑。好的，等等。我们一起来看吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13498.229, "timestamp": "03:44:58", "text": "即时的。希望有效。三，二，"}]